  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/163054137-8bdde290-e939-4f6a-a788-4842866cb1bf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">本附加组件用于 <a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations\" rel=\"nofollow\">Loot Integrations</a>，可增强</span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/towns-and-towers\" rel=\"nofollow\">Towns and Towers</a> 结构的战利品。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">战利品将更加多样，并从相似的原版战利品表中随机抽取，其中还包含模组战利品，以确保与所有添加战利品的模组兼容。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">仅服务端必需</span><br><img style=\"font-size:18px\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/163059508-bfcdb9fc-5f49-4204-afff-d9ae9460beda.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">暂无已知冲突，可与其他任意模组兼容运行。</span></p>",
